    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Rush Simulator is a relaxing first-person simulation where you manage every aspect of your fast food restaurant. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfe<strong>TAKE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle cash or credit card payments at the checkout, or hire a cashier to manage it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/7bdbf38de1bfb332914666e06cd5e1fd.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/7bdbf38de1bfb332914666e06cd5e1fd.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/7bdbf38de1bfb332914666e06cd5e1fd.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97<strong>DRIVE THRU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your sales by unlocking the drive-thru and upgrading your restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/2a2883a7a2126de27797340bf323b44c.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/2a2883a7a2126de27797340bf323b44c.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/2a2883a7a2126de27797340bf323b44c.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6<strong>RESTOCK CONTAINERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game computer to order supplies and restock food containers and kitchen equipment as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/f81a622ff45c12539b4a89d7cb05f542.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/f81a622ff45c12539b4a89d7cb05f542.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/f81a622ff45c12539b4a89d7cb05f542.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf5f<strong>PREPARE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare burgers, fries, ice cream, coffee, and drinks to serve your customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/c23c7de032a024be788dad149b1d9236.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/c23c7de032a024be788dad149b1d9236.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/c23c7de032a024be788dad149b1d9236.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>DESIGN AND IMPROVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tables and kitchen equipment, improve both capacity and capability, grow your business, and serve more customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/ed471013d0d7deeb5e0f037559e34080.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/ed471013d0d7deeb5e0f037559e34080.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/ed471013d0d7deeb5e0f037559e34080.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8<strong>COMPETE WITH THE MARKET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock menus and set your own prices to maximize profits with smart pricing choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/4a7bb58d2112b467de50e41c530f80d6.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/4a7bb58d2112b467de50e41c530f80d6.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/4a7bb58d2112b467de50e41c530f80d6.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Rush Simulator is a relaxing first-person simulation where you manage every aspect of your fast food restaurant. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfe<strong>TAKE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle cash or credit card payments at the checkout, or hire a cashier to manage it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/7bdbf38de1bfb332914666e06cd5e1fd.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/7bdbf38de1bfb332914666e06cd5e1fd.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/7bdbf38de1bfb332914666e06cd5e1fd.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97<strong>DRIVE THRU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your sales by unlocking the drive-thru and upgrading your restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/2a2883a7a2126de27797340bf323b44c.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/2a2883a7a2126de27797340bf323b44c.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/2a2883a7a2126de27797340bf323b44c.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6<strong>RESTOCK CONTAINERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game computer to order supplies and restock food containers and kitchen equipment as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/f81a622ff45c12539b4a89d7cb05f542.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/f81a622ff45c12539b4a89d7cb05f542.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/f81a622ff45c12539b4a89d7cb05f542.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf5f<strong>PREPARE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare burgers, fries, ice cream, coffee, and drinks to serve your customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/c23c7de032a024be788dad149b1d9236.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/c23c7de032a024be788dad149b1d9236.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/c23c7de032a024be788dad149b1d9236.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>DESIGN AND IMPROVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tables and kitchen equipment, improve both capacity and capability, grow your business, and serve more customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/ed471013d0d7deeb5e0f037559e34080.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/ed471013d0d7deeb5e0f037559e34080.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/ed471013d0d7deeb5e0f037559e34080.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8<strong>COMPETE WITH THE MARKET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock menus and set your own prices to maximize profits with smart pricing choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/4a7bb58d2112b467de50e41c530f80d6.poster.avif?t=1755216128\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/4a7bb58d2112b467de50e41c530f80d6.webm?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/4a7bb58d2112b467de50e41c530f80d6.mp4?t=1755216128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
